a:3:{s:4:"time";i:1757571268;s:3:"ttl";i:1200;s:4:"data";a:4:{s:8:"category";a:26:{s:2:"id";s:1:"6";s:4:"name";s:18:"Japan Youth Summit";s:11:"description";s:934:"	Japan Youth Summit, organized by the Youth Break the Boundaries (YBB) Foundation, is an international innovation competition and youth summit that aims to inspire emerging leaders to push the limits of their potential, come together, and implement strategies under the main theme of “Pioneering Innovation for Sustainable Futures.” The summit promotes collaboration among diverse young people from various fields to harness their leadership skills in working toward achieving sustainable development goals. The Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) are a set of goals that serve as a guide for countries worldwide in their development effort, replacing the Millennium Development Goals (MDGs) that concluded in 2015. The SDGs encompass a range of areas, including Education (SDG 4), Economy (SDG 8), Industry, Innovation, and Infrastructure (SDG 9), Sustainable Cities and Communities (SDG 11), as well as Climate Action (SDG 13).";s:5:"about";s:1253:"<p><strong>Japan Youth Summit</strong>, organized by the <strong>Youth Break the Boundaries (YBB) Foundation</strong>, is an <strong><u>international innovation competition and youth summit that aims to inspire emerging leaders to push the limits of their potential, come together, and implement strategies under the main theme of “Pioneering Innovation for Sustainable Futures.”</u></strong> The summit promotes collaboration among diverse young people from various fields to harness their leadership skills in working toward achieving sustainable development goals. The Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) are a set of goals that serve as a guide for countries worldwide in their development effort, replacing the Millennium Development Goals (MDGs) that concluded in 2015. The SDGs encompass a range of areas, including <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">Education (SDG 4)</strong>, <strong style="color: rgb(153, 51, 255);">Economy (SDG 8)</strong>, <strong style="color: rgb(255, 153, 0);">Industry, Innovation, and Infrastructure (SDG 9)</strong>, <strong style="color: rgb(194, 133, 255);">Sustainable Cities and Communities (SDG 11)</strong>, as well as <strong style="color: rgb(240, 102, 102);">Climate Action (SDG 13)</strong>.</p>";s:11:"core_values";s:1159:"<p class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="color: rgb(19, 19, 30);">JAPAN YOUTH SUMMIT VISION</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Inspiring young leaders to create innovative solutions that harmonize sustainability with the preservation and celebration of cultural heritage. By fostering creativity and collaboration, the program empowers participants to drive meaningful change in their communities.</span></p><p><br></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="color: rgb(19, 19, 30);">JAPAN YOUTH SUMMIT MISSION</strong></p><ol><li class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Elevate</strong> the professionalism, capabilities, and reliability of humans.</li><li class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Empower</strong> youth to understand and fulfill their roles as the spearhead of national development.</li><li class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Cultivate</strong> a sense of responsibility and leadership among young individuals to actively contribute to the development of their nations.</li><li class="ql-align-justify"><strong>Foster</strong> agility among youth to effectively respond to future challenges.</li></ol><p><br></p>";s:10:"objectives";s:1144:"<p class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">The Japan Youth Summit program is held to achieve the following objectives:</strong></p><ol><li class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent;">Build the character of youth leadership.</span></li><li class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent;">Build the confidence of the youth through competition.</span></li><li class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent;">Sharpen up the ability to see and take advantage of opportunities.</span></li><li class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent;">Build the existence of the youth at the international level.</span></li><li class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent;">Train the spirit of collaboration to actively contribute to building the country.</span></li><li class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent;">Create a robust network and lasting connections among YBB alumni to ensure the continuity of the program for years to come.</span></li></ol><p><br></p>";s:8:"benefits";s:811:"<p><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Delegate Benefits:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Exclusive Forum</strong>: Gain insights from international figures in youth and innovation</li><li><strong>Peer Support</strong>: Engage in group discussions with accomplished individuals</li><li><strong>Collaboration Opportunities</strong>: Collaborate with participants from diverse backgrounds to generate new ideas</li><li><strong>Valuable Networking</strong>: Build lifelong connections with fellow participants</li><li><strong>Scholarship Opportunities</strong>: Explore potential scholarships during the program</li><li><strong>Certificates and Awards</strong>: <strong style="color: rgb(230, 0, 0);">Receive exclusive certificates and stand a chance to win awards for your contributions</strong></li></ol><p><br></p>";s:15:"program_type_id";s:1:"2";s:7:"web_url";s:20:"japanyouthsummit.com";s:8:"logo_url";s:46:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/logo/jys.png";s:15:"main_banner_url";s:83:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/program-categories/6/images/banner_1745045216.jpg";s:14:"main_video_url";s:61:"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tUR55Fi53rM?si=NtuTc1RVhzcl7lgh";s:7:"tagline";s:21:"Innovate for Tomorrow";s:7:"contact";s:14:"+6285173386622";s:8:"location";s:12:"Osaka, Japan";s:5:"email";s:26:"japanyouthsummit@gmail.com";s:9:"instagram";s:50:"https://www.instagram.com/japanyouthsummitofficial";s:6:"tiktok";s:48:"https://www.tiktok.com/@japanyouthsummitofficial";s:7:"youtube";s:38:"https://www.youtube.com/@ybbfoundation";s:8:"telegram";s:29:"https://t.me/japanyouthsummit";s:11:"sponsor_url";s:74:"https://www.canva.com/design/DAGmxOhQmkM/z8vNE6GeODnN_AFg7NwRpQ/view?embed";s:21:"verification_required";s:1:"0";s:9:"is_active";s:1:"1";s:10:"is_deleted";s:1:"0";s:10:"created_at";s:19:"2024-09-20 20:25:06";s:10:"updated_at";s:19:"2025-06-17 12:51:55";}s:14:"activePrograms";a:1:{i:0;a:23:{s:2:"id";s:1:"7";s:19:"program_category_id";s:1:"6";s:4:"name";s:23:"Japan Youth Summit 2025";s:10:"banner_url";s:73:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/programs/7/images/banner_1752753149.jpg";s:11:"description";s:1605:"<p class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Japan Youth Summit</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">, organized by the Youth Break the Boundaries (YBB) Foundation, is a</span>n international innovation competition and youth summit that aims to inspire emerging leaders to push the limits of their potential, come together, and implement strategies under the main theme of “<strong style="color: rgb(230, 0, 0);">Pioneering Innovation for Sustainable Futures</strong>.”<span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"> The summit promotes collaboration among diverse young people from various fields to harness their leadership skills in working toward achieving sustainable development goals. The Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) are a set of goals that serve as a guide for countries worldwide in their development effort, replacing the Millennium Development Goals (MDGs) that concluded in 2015. The SDGs encompass a range of areas, including</span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"> Education (SDG 4)</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">, </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Economy (SDG 8)</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">, </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Industry, Innovation, and Infrastructure (SDG 9</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">), </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Sustainable Cities and Communities (SDG 11)</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">, as well as </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Climate Action (SDG 13</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">).</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>";s:9:"guideline";s:30:"https://bit.ly/JYS25Guidelines";s:19:"main_essay_question";s:213:"As a youth leader, how have you contributed — or how do you plan to contribute — to advancing solutions within your chosen SDG focus area to create sustainable and inclusive change in your community or beyond?";s:19:"essay_guideline_url";s:23:"https://bit.ly/EssayJYS";s:7:"twibbon";s:32:"https://www.twibbonize.com/jys25";s:17:"twibbon_video_url";s:42:"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/vRQx0PFJ6xc";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2025-10-12 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2025-10-15 00:00:00";s:22:"registration_video_url";s:61:"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tUR55Fi53rM?si=NtuTc1RVhzcl7lgh";s:16:"tshirt_chart_url";s:64:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/general-files/tshirt_chart.jpg";s:5:"theme";s:45:"Pioneering Innovation for Sustainable Futures";s:10:"share_desc";s:2356:"<p><strong>Note</strong>: As mentioned in the Registration Guidelines, you need to complete the following steps:</p><ul><li>Follow our TikTok and Instagram accounts:<span style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"> </span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/youthbreaktheboundaries/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"><strong>Youth Break the Boundaries Instagram</strong></a><strong>,</strong><span style="color: rgb(204, 224, 245);"> </span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/japanyouthsummitofficial" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"><strong><u>Japan Youth Summit Instagram</u></strong></a>, <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@youthbreaktheboundaries" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"><strong>Youth Break the Boundaries TikTok</strong></a>, <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@japanyouthsummitofficial" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Japan Youth Summit TikTok</strong></a></li><li>Join our Telegram channels: <a href="https://t.me/youthbreaktheboundaries" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"><strong>Youth Break the Boundaries Telegram</strong></a>, <a href="https://t.me/japanyouthsummit" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"><strong><u>Japan Youth Summit Telegram</u></strong></a></li><li>Subscribe to the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ybbfoundation" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"><strong>YBB YouTube Channel</strong></a></li><li>Tag <strong>5 of your friends</strong> and <strong>@youthbreaktheboundaries</strong>, <strong>@japanyouthsummitofficial</strong> on your posted twibbon on Instagram or any other social media platform.</li><li>Share the program information for the Japan Youth Summit using this poster: <a href="https://bit.ly/JYS25Poster" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);"><strong>"Japan Youth Summit Poster"</strong></a> with 3 WhatsApp groups or any other social media groups.</li></ul><p>Take a screenshot of each action mentioned above and upload them to your storage drive. Then, copy the link and paste it into the input forms provided above. Ensure that the folder is <strong>accessible to the public</strong> and not set to private.</p>";s:17:"confirmation_desc";s:1722:"<h1>Japan Youth Summit 2025</h1><p>The Japan Youth Summit provides both <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">Fully Funded</strong> and <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">Self-Funded</strong> Opportunities. To qualify for <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">Full Funding</strong>, delegates must complete all registration steps and fulfill payment by the specified deadline. If not selected for Full Funding, delegates can still participate through a self-funded scheme.</p><p><br></p><p>The comprehensive expenses outlined in the Japan Youth Summit payment cover accommodation throughout the program (<strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">October 12 - 15, 2025</strong>), including airport transfers on the first day (<strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">October 12, 2025</strong>, for transfer from the airport to the hotel) and the last day of the program (<strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">October 15, 2025</strong>, for transfer from the hotel to the airport). It's crucial to note that all fully funded or self-funded payments do not cover flight tickets and visa expenses. The fully-funded spots will be allocated based on the registrants' quality.</p><p><br></p><p>With a delegate quota limited to only <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">200 youth</strong>, let's join hands and collaborate at the Japan Youth Summit 2025. Your contribution is <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">essential</strong> for a shared and <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">impactful</strong> experience.</p><p><br></p><p class="ql-align-center"><em>I am </em><strong><em>ready</em></strong><em> to join the Japan Youth Summit 2025 in </em><strong><em>Osaka, Japan</em></strong><em>.</em></p>";s:9:"is_active";s:1:"1";s:20:"is_registration_open";s:1:"1";s:10:"is_deleted";s:1:"0";s:10:"created_at";s:19:"2024-02-12 20:29:22";s:10:"updated_at";s:19:"2025-07-20 12:38:36";s:21:"registration_payments";a:2:{s:11:"self_funded";a:8:{s:2:"id";s:2:"31";s:4:"name";s:30:"Registration Fee (Self-Funded)";s:11:"description";s:30:"Registration Fee (Self-Funded)";s:10:"usd_amount";s:5:"15.00";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2025-07-17 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2025-09-09 00:00:00";s:12:"is_available";b:0;s:9:"is_active";b:1;}s:12:"fully_funded";a:8:{s:2:"id";s:2:"27";s:4:"name";s:31:"Registration Fee (Fully Funded)";s:11:"description";s:31:"Registration Fee (Fully Funded)";s:10:"usd_amount";s:5:"10.00";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2025-04-21 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2025-07-01 00:00:00";s:12:"is_available";b:0;s:9:"is_active";b:1;}}}}s:16:"previousPrograms";a:0:{}s:13:"otherPrograms";a:5:{i:0;a:25:{s:2:"id";s:2:"10";s:19:"program_category_id";s:1:"1";s:4:"name";s:26:"Istanbul Youth Summit 2026";s:10:"banner_url";s:74:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/programs/10/images/banner_1754397811.jpg";s:11:"description";s:2032:"<p class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">The Istanbul Youth Summit (IYS)</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;"> is a premier international platform that empowers young leaders to address global challenges through innovation, collaboration, and transformative leadership. Organized by the Youth Break the Boundaries (YBB) Foundation, IYS cultivates a dynamic environment where youth gain the confidence, skills, and global outlook needed to become catalysts for change.</span></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">More than just a gathering, IYS is a space where ideas come to life. Through inspiring talks, interactive sessions, and meaningful group activities, participants are encouraged to explore new perspectives, grow as leaders, and connect with youth from around the world. The summit promotes open dialogue and practical learning in a supportive and inclusive setting.</span></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">A highlight of the program is </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">the Social Project Competition</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">, which invites delegates to propose creative initiatives aimed at solving global issues or empowering their communities. It is an opportunity to turn ideas into action and make a lasting contribution with real impact.</span></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">At IYS, participants are not only learners but also active contributors. The summit offers opportunities for cultural exchange, collaboration, and lasting friendships among emerging leaders from different countries. With the support of experienced mentors and global peers, IYS helps shape a new generation ready to lead and inspire change across borders.</span></p>";s:9:"guideline";s:30:"https://bit.ly/guidelinesiys26";s:19:"main_essay_question";s:145:"How can a youth-led social initiative effectively address challenges within one of the SDG focus areas while ensuring long-term community impact?";s:19:"essay_guideline_url";s:23:"https://bit.ly/EssayIYS";s:7:"twibbon";s:25:"https://twibbo.nz/iys2026";s:17:"twibbon_video_url";s:58:"https://youtube.com/shorts/9hyuDNUpSjc?si=NnJq43HccEWe_JHQ";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2026-02-09 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2026-02-12 00:00:00";s:22:"registration_video_url";s:61:"https://www.youtube.com/embed/begwqSG5VCE?si=EzjD-6WXfwLEJGQb";s:16:"tshirt_chart_url";s:0:"";s:5:"theme";s:65:"From Vision to Action: Empowering Youth for Lasting Global Impact";s:10:"share_desc";s:1764:"<p><strong>Note</strong>: As mentioned in the Registration Guidelines, you need to do the following steps:</p><ul><li>Follow our TikTok and Instagram accounts: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/youthbreaktheboundaries/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Youth Break the Boundaries Instagram</a> <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@youthbreaktheboundaries" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Youth Break the Boundaries TikTok</a> <a href="https://www.instagram.com/istanbulyouthsummit/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Istanbul Youth Summit Instagram</a> <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@istanbulyouthsummit" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Istanbul Youth Summit TikTok</a></li><li>Join our telegram channels: <a href="https://t.me/youthbreaktheboundaries/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Youth Break the Boundaries Telegram channel</a> <a href="https://t.me/IYS2022Sponsorship" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Istanbul Youth Summit Telegram channel</a></li><li>Subscribe <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ybbfoundation" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">YBB YouTube channel </a></li><li>Tag 5 of your friends and @youthbreaktheboundaries @istanbulyouthsummit on your posted twibbon on Instagram or any other social media platform.</li><li>Share the program information for the Istanbul Youth Summit <a href="https://bit.ly/IYS25poster" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Istanbul Youth Summit</a> with 3 WhatsApp groups or any other social media groups.</li></ul><p>Take a screenshot of each action mentioned above and upload them to your storage drive. Then, copy the link and paste it into the input forms provided above. Ensure that the folder is accessible to the public and not private.</p>";s:17:"confirmation_desc";s:1719:"<h1>Istanbul Youth Summit 2025</h1><p>The Istanbul Youth Summit provides both <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">Fully Funded</strong> and <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">Self-Funded</strong> Opportunities. To qualify for <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">Full Funding</strong>, delegates must complete all registration steps and fulfill payment by the specified deadline. If not selected for Full Funding, delegates can still participate through a self-funded scheme.</p><p>The comprehensive expenses outlined in the Istanbul Youth Summit payment cover accommodation throughout the program (<strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">February 9 - 12, 2026</strong>), including airport transfers on the first day (<strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">February 9, 2026</strong>, for transfer from the airport to the hotel) and the last day of the program (<strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">February 12, 2026</strong>, for transfer from the hotel to the airport). It's crucial to note that all fully funded or self-funded payments do not cover flight tickets and visa expenses. The fully-funded spots will be allocated based on the registrants' quality.</p><p>With a delegate quota limited to only <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">200 youth</strong>, let's join hands and collaborate at the Istanbul Youth Summit 2026. Your contribution is <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">essential</strong> for a shared and <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">impactful</strong> experience.</p><p class="ql-align-center"><em>I am </em><strong><em>ready</em></strong><em> to join the Istanbul Youth Summit 2026 in </em><strong><em>Istanbul, Turkiye</em></strong><em>.</em></p>";s:9:"is_active";s:1:"1";s:20:"is_registration_open";s:1:"1";s:10:"is_deleted";s:1:"0";s:10:"created_at";s:19:"2025-07-16 20:29:22";s:10:"updated_at";s:19:"2025-08-05 12:43:31";s:7:"web_url";s:23:"istanbulyouthsummit.com";s:8:"logo_url";s:81:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/program-categories/1/images/logo_1745006651.png";s:21:"registration_payments";a:2:{s:11:"self_funded";a:8:{s:2:"id";s:2:"43";s:4:"name";s:28:"Registration Fee-Self Funded";s:11:"description";s:28:"Registration Fee-Self Funded";s:10:"usd_amount";s:5:"15.00";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2025-08-06 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2025-12-31 00:00:00";s:12:"is_available";b:1;s:9:"is_active";b:1;}s:12:"fully_funded";a:8:{s:2:"id";s:2:"37";s:4:"name";s:31:"Registration Fee - Fully Funded";s:11:"description";s:33:"Registration Fee for Fully Funded";s:10:"usd_amount";s:5:"10.00";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2025-08-06 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2025-09-30 00:00:00";s:12:"is_available";b:1;s:9:"is_active";b:1;}}}i:1;a:25:{s:2:"id";s:1:"9";s:19:"program_category_id";s:1:"4";s:4:"name";s:23:"Korea Youth Summit 2026";s:10:"banner_url";s:73:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/programs/9/images/banner_1754394111.jpg";s:11:"description";s:2330:"<p class="ql-align-center"><strong style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">KOREA YOUTH SUMMIT</strong></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">The Korea Youth Summit (KYS)</strong><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"> is an inspiring international gathering that brings together young changemakers to explore the power of culture in shaping inclusive, creative, and resilient societies. Organized by the Youth Break the Boundaries (YBB) Foundation, KYS places youth at the heart of cultural preservation and innovation, celebrating Korea’s global reputation as a vibrant cultural hub.</span></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Carrying the tagline “Living Culture, Lasting Legacy,” the summit fosters deep reflection and action on how tradition and modernity can coexist. Through insightful sessions, cultural immersion, and collaborative learning, participants are encouraged to rethink the role of youth in preserving heritage, reimagining identity, and fostering intercultural understanding.</span></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">A signature element of the summit is </span><strong style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">the Cultural Project Competition, where delegates propose creative solutions and campaigns to preserve, celebrate, and innovate around local and global cultural values.</strong><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"> These youth-led initiatives aim to address real-world cultural challenges while promoting diversity and unity.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">KYS is more than an event. It's a movement that </span><strong style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">empowers young people to be cultural ambassadors, innovators, and protectors of legacy.</strong><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"> By building bridges across nations and traditions, the summit provides an immersive platform for dialogue, learning, and collaboration among future leaders committed to making culture a force for positive change.</span></p>";s:9:"guideline";s:32:"https://bit.ly/guidelinesKYS2026";s:19:"main_essay_question";s:145:"How can a youth-led social initiative effectively address challenges within one of the SDG focus areas while ensuring long-term community impact?";s:19:"essay_guideline_url";s:0:"";s:7:"twibbon";s:25:"https://twibbo.nz/kys2025";s:17:"twibbon_video_url";s:23:"https://twibbo.nz/kys26";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2026-02-02 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2026-02-05 00:00:00";s:22:"registration_video_url";s:61:"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1m7BQbCC1g0?si=OkUDLu20eLT8-LDw";s:16:"tshirt_chart_url";s:64:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/general-files/tshirt_chart.jpg";s:5:"theme";s:54:"Connecting Generations Through Cultural Collaboration";s:10:"share_desc";s:1772:"<p><strong>Note</strong>: As mentioned in the Registration Guidelines, you need to do the following steps:</p><ul><li>Follow our Instagram and TikTok accounts: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/youthbreaktheboundaries/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Youth Break the Boundaries Instagram</a>, <a href="https://www.instagram.com/koreayouthsummit/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Korea Youth Summit Instagram</a>, <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@youthbreaktheboundaries" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Youth Break the Boundaries TikTok</a>, <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@koreayouthsummit" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Korea Youth Summit TikTok</a></li><li>Join our Telegram channels: <a href="https://t.me/youthbreaktheboundaries" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Youth Break the Boundaries Telegram channel</a>, <a href="https://t.me/koreayouthsummit" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Korea Youth Summit Telegram channel</a></li><li>Subscribe to the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ybbfoundation" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">YBB YouTube channel</a></li><li>Tag 5 of your friends and @youthbreaktheboundaries @koreayouthsummit on your posted twibbon on Instagram or any other social media platform.</li><li>Share the program information for the Korea Youth Summit (<a href="https://bit.ly/POSTERKYS2025" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Korea Youth Summit Poster &amp; Caption</a>) with 3 WhatsApp groups or any other social media groups.</li></ul><p>Take a screenshot of each action mentioned above and upload them to your storage drive. Then, copy the link and paste it into the input forms provided above. Ensure that the folder is accessible to the public and not private.</p>";s:17:"confirmation_desc";s:1581:"<h2><strong>Korea Youth Summit 2026</strong></h2><p><br></p><p>The Korea Youth Summit offers both <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">Fully Funded</strong> and <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">Self-Funded</strong> opportunities. To qualify for <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">Full Funding</strong>, delegates must complete all registration steps and meet the payment deadline. If not selected for Full Funding, delegates can still participate through the self-funded scheme.</p><p>The comprehensive expenses outlined in the Korea Youth Summit payment cover accommodation throughout the program (<strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">February 2 - 5, 2026</strong>), including airport transfers on the first day (<strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">February 2, 2026</strong>, from the airport to the hotel) and the last day of the program (<strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">February 5, 2026</strong>, from the hotel to the airport). Please note that all fully funded and self-funded payments do not include flight tickets or visa expenses. Fully funded spots will be awarded based on the quality of applicants.</p><p>Let’s join hands and collaborate at the Korea Youth Summit 2026. Your involvement is <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">essential</strong> for a powerful and <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">meaningful</strong> experience.</p><p class="ql-align-center"><em>I am </em><strong><em>ready</em></strong><em> to join the Korea Youth Summit 2026 in </em><strong><em>Seoul, South Korea</em></strong><em>.</em></p>";s:9:"is_active";s:1:"1";s:20:"is_registration_open";s:1:"1";s:10:"is_deleted";s:1:"0";s:10:"created_at";s:19:"2025-07-16 20:29:22";s:10:"updated_at";s:19:"2025-08-08 14:34:29";s:7:"web_url";s:20:"koreayouthsummit.com";s:8:"logo_url";s:46:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/logo/KYS.png";s:21:"registration_payments";a:2:{s:11:"self_funded";a:8:{s:2:"id";s:2:"40";s:4:"name";s:30:"Registration Fee (Self-Funded)";s:11:"description";s:30:"Registration Fee (Self-Funded)";s:10:"usd_amount";s:5:"15.00";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2025-08-06 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2026-01-03 00:00:00";s:12:"is_available";b:1;s:9:"is_active";b:1;}s:12:"fully_funded";a:8:{s:2:"id";s:2:"36";s:4:"name";s:31:"Registration Fee (Fully Funded)";s:11:"description";s:31:"Registration Fee (Fully Funded)";s:10:"usd_amount";s:5:"10.00";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2025-08-06 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2025-09-17 00:00:00";s:12:"is_available";b:1;s:9:"is_active";b:1;}}}i:2;a:25:{s:2:"id";s:1:"8";s:19:"program_category_id";s:1:"3";s:4:"name";s:29:"Middle East Youth Summit 2025";s:10:"banner_url";s:73:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/programs/8/images/banner_1748458692.jpg";s:11:"description";s:2048:"<p class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">MEYS MAIN THEME</strong></p><p class="ql-align-center"><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Empowering Emerging Leaders for Positive Change within the Islamic Brotherhood</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">SUBTHEMES</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="background-color: transparent;">SDG 4 – Quality Education</strong></li></ul><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent;">To provide inclusive and equitable education that equips youth with skills, knowledge, and values for leadership.</span></p><ul><li class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="background-color: transparent;">SDG 5 – Gender Equality</strong></li></ul><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent;">To ensure equal opportunities for young Muslim women and men to lead and contribute meaningfully to society.</span></p><ul><li class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="background-color: transparent;">SDG 10 – Reduced Inequality</strong></li></ul><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent;">To empower marginalized youth and reduce socio-economic disparities within the Muslim community.</span></p><ul><li class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="background-color: transparent;">SDG 16 – Peace, Justice, and Strong Institutions</strong></li></ul><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent;">To cultivate active youth leaders committed to justice, transparency, and peaceful civic engagement.</span></p><ul><li class="ql-align-justify"><strong style="background-color: transparent;">SDG 17 – Partnerships for the Goals</strong></li></ul><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: transparent;">To strengthen intergenerational and cross-border collaborations for sustainable impact within the Islamic world.</span></p><p><br></p>";s:9:"guideline";s:33:"https://bit.ly/GuidelineMEYS2025 ";s:19:"main_essay_question";s:115:"How can Muslims contribute to building a just, inclusive, and sustainable society despite the challenges they face?";s:19:"essay_g