's crucial to note that all fully funded or self-funded payments do not cover flight tickets and visa expenses. The fully-funded spots will be allocated based on the registrants' quality.</p><p><br></p><p>With a delegate quota limited to only <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">200 youth</strong>, let's join hands and collaborate at the Middle East Youth Summit 2025. Your contribution is <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">essential</strong> for a shared and <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">impactful</strong> experience.</p><p><br></p><p class="ql-align-center"><em>I am </em><strong><em>ready</em></strong><em> to join the</em><strong><em> Middle East Youth Summit 2025</em></strong><em> in </em><strong><em>Makkah Al Mukarramah, Saudi Arabia.</em></strong></p>";s:9:"is_active";s:1:"1";s:20:"is_registration_open";s:1:"1";s:10:"is_deleted";s:1:"0";s:10:"created_at";s:19:"2025-04-29 20:29:22";s:10:"updated_at";s:19:"2025-07-08 04:53:56";s:7:"web_url";s:25:"middleeastyouthsummit.com";s:8:"logo_url";s:47:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/logo/MEYS.png";s:21:"registration_payments";a:2:{s:11:"self_funded";a:8:{s:2:"id";s:2:"34";s:4:"name";s:30:"Registration Fee (Self-Funded)";s:11:"description";s:30:"Registration Fee (Self-Funded)";s:10:"usd_amount";s:5:"15.00";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2025-09-16 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2025-11-09 00:00:00";s:12:"is_available";b:0;s:9:"is_active";b:1;}s:12:"fully_funded";a:8:{s:2:"id";s:2:"28";s:4:"name";s:31:"Registration Fee (Fully Funded)";s:11:"description";s:31:"Registration Fee (Fully Funded)";s:10:"usd_amount";s:5:"10.00";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2025-08-01 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2025-09-15 00:00:00";s:12:"is_available";b:1;s:9:"is_active";b:1;}}}i:3;a:25:{s:2:"id";s:1:"4";s:19:"program_category_id";s:1:"5";s:4:"name";s:25:"Youth Academic Forum 2025";s:10:"banner_url";s:73:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/programs/4/images/banner_1749469538.jpg";s:11:"description";s:1280:"<p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">The </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Youth Academic Forum</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">, an initiative of </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Youth Break the Boundaries (YBB)</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">, stands as a dynamic and inclusive platform designed to elevate and empower the </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">young research community</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">. With a steadfast commitment to promoting </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">original, objective, and credible research</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">, the forum provides accessible pathways for young researchers to publish and present their work on a global stage.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">More than just a publication platform, the Youth Academic Forum is a </span><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">hub of intellectual exchange</strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">, where emerging scholars, practitioners, and change-makers collaborate, learn, and grow. We believe that meaningful research should not remain confined to academic institutions but should inform real-world progress, policy, and innovation.</span></p>";s:9:"guideline";s:32:"https://bit.ly/RegistrationYAF25";s:19:"main_essay_question";s:0:"";s:19:"essay_guideline_url";s:34:"https://bit.ly/writingguidelineYAF";s:7:"twibbon";s:23:"https://twibbo.nz/yaf25";s:17:"twibbon_video_url";s:42:"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/LE-YeKe-exw";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2025-12-08 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2025-12-11 00:00:00";s:22:"registration_video_url";s:61:"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iTaAbFK_iyY?si=nu8hMI37M0cNS9L4";s:16:"tshirt_chart_url";s:0:"";s:5:"theme";s:127:"Building the Foundation of Innovation and Cross-Disciplinary Collaboration for Youth Intellectual Development on a Global Scale";s:10:"share_desc";s:1788:"<p><strong>Note</strong>: As mentioned in the Registration Guidelines, you need to do the following steps:</p><ul><li>Follow our Instagram and TikTok accounts: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/youthbreaktheboundaries/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Youth Break the Boundaries Instagram</a>, <a href="https://www.instagram.com/youthacademicforum/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Youth Academic Forum Instagram</a>, <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@youthbreaktheboundaries" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Youth Break the Boundaries TikTok</a>, <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@youthacademicforum" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Youth Academic Forum TikTok</a></li><li>Join our Telegram channels: <a href="https://t.me/youthbreaktheboundaries" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Youth Break the Boundaries Telegram channel</a>, <a href="https://t.me/youthacademicforum" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Youth Academic Forum Telegram channel</a></li><li>Subscribe to the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ybbfoundation" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">YBB YouTube channel</a></li><li>Tag 5 of your friends and @youthbreaktheboundaries @youthacademicforum on your posted twibbon on Instagram or any other social media platform.</li><li>Share the program information for the Youth Academic Forum (<a href="https://bit.ly/POSTERYAF25" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Youth Academic Forum Poster &amp; Caption</a>) with 3 WhatsApp groups or any other social media groups.</li></ul><p>Take a screenshot of each action mentioned above and upload them to your storage drive. Then, copy the link and paste it into the input forms provided above. Ensure that the folder is accessible to the public and not private.</p>";s:17:"confirmation_desc";s:1653:"<h1>Youth Academic Forum 2025</h1><p>The Youth Academic Forum offers both <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">Fully Funded</strong> and <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">Self-Funded</strong> opportunities. To qualify for <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">Full Funding</strong>, delegates must complete all registration steps and meet the payment deadline. If not selected for Full Funding, delegates can still participate through the self-funded scheme.</p><p>The comprehensive expenses outlined in the Youth Academic Forum payment cover accommodation throughout the program (<strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">December 8-11, 2025</strong>), including airport transfers on the first day (<strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">December 11, 2025</strong>, from the airport to the hotel) and the last day of the program (<strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">December 8, 2025</strong>, from the hotel to the airport). Please note that all fully funded and self-funded payments do not include flight tickets or visa expenses. Fully funded spots will be awarded based on the quality of applicants.</p><p>With a delegate quota limited to just <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">100 youth</strong>, let’s join hands and collaborate at the Youth Academic Forum 2025. Your involvement is <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">essential</strong> for a powerful and <strong style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">meaningful</strong> experience.</p><p class="ql-align-center"><em>I am </em><strong><em>ready</em></strong><em> to join the Youth Academic Forum 2025 in </em><strong><em>Bangkok, Thailand</em></strong><em>.</em></p>";s:9:"is_active";s:1:"1";s:20:"is_registration_open";s:1:"1";s:10:"is_deleted";s:1:"0";s:10:"created_at";s:19:"2024-10-21 20:29:22";s:10:"updated_at";s:19:"2025-07-02 16:20:48";s:7:"web_url";s:22:"youthacademicforum.com";s:8:"logo_url";s:46:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/logo/YAF.png";s:21:"registration_payments";a:2:{s:11:"self_funded";a:8:{s:2:"id";s:2:"16";s:4:"name";s:30:"Registration Fee (Self-Funded)";s:11:"description";s:30:"Registration Fee (Self-Funded)";s:10:"usd_amount";s:5:"13.00";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2025-07-08 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2025-09-30 00:00:00";s:12:"is_available";b:1;s:9:"is_active";b:1;}s:12:"fully_funded";a:8:{s:2:"id";s:2:"12";s:4:"name";s:31:"Registration Fee (Fully Funded)";s:11:"description";s:31:"Registration Fee (Fully Funded)";s:10:"usd_amount";s:5:"10.00";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2025-07-08 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2025-09-02 00:00:00";s:12:"is_available";b:0;s:9:"is_active";b:1;}}}i:4;a:25:{s:2:"id";s:1:"6";s:19:"program_category_id";s:1:"2";s:4:"name";s:21:"World Youth Fest 2025";s:10:"banner_url";s:73:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/programs/6/images/banner_1745011052.png";s:11:"description";s:1028:"<p><strong>The World Youth Festival (WYF)</strong>, is orchestrated by the <strong>Youth Break the Boundaries (YBB) Foundation</strong>. This platform is designed to cultivate the spirit of entrepreneurship, encourage collaboration, and foster the contribution of youth globally. Additionally, it aims to ensure the readiness of the next generation to tackle the challenges of the future.</p><p>The dynamic platform serves as a global hub for young visionaries, where innovative ideas converge to shape a brighter tomorrow. The festival also provides a unique opportunity for young leaders from diverse backgrounds to connect, exchange ideas, and collaborate on projects that benefit society.</p><p>Through <strong>interactive workshops, insightful discussions, and networking sessions</strong>, participants gain valuable skills and insights to drive positive change in their communities and beyond. Together, participants embark on a transformative journey towards a more <strong>sustainable and inclusive future</strong>.</p>";s:9:"guideline";s:29:"http://bit.ly/WYF25guidelines";s:19:"main_essay_question";s:132:"What innovative business ideas can you propose to accelerate progress toward achieving the SDG while creating lasting social impact?";s:19:"essay_guideline_url";s:25:"https://bit.ly/EssayWYF25";s:7:"twibbon";s:23:"https://twibbo.nz/wyf25";s:17:"twibbon_video_url";s:42:"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/0k17nAF5fnM";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2025-10-06 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2025-10-09 00:00:00";s:22:"registration_video_url";s:61:"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nrBa3CfSLzc?si=wI5qaRD5ZP3r0Ddr";s:16:"tshirt_chart_url";s:64:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/general-files/tshirt_chart.jpg";s:5:"theme";s:48:"Cultivating Youth Creativity in Entrepreneurship";s:10:"share_desc";s:2125:"<p><strong>Note</strong>: As mentioned in the Registration Guidelines, you need to complete the following steps:</p><ul><li>Follow our TikTok and Instagram accounts: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/youthbreaktheboundaries/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">Youth Break the Boundaries Instagram</a>, <a href="https://www.instagram.com/worldyouthfestival/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">World Youth Festival Instagram</a>, <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@youthbreaktheboundaries" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">Youth Break the Boundaries TikTok</a>, <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@worldyouthfestival" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">World Youth Festival TikTok</a></li><li>Join our Telegram channels: <a href="https://t.me/youthbreaktheboundaries" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">Youth Break the Boundaries Telegram</a>, <a href="https://t.me/worldyouthfestival" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">World Youth Festival Telegram</a></li><li>Subscribe to the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ybbfoundation" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">YBB YouTube Channel</a></li><li>Tag <strong>5 of your friends</strong> and <strong>@youthbreaktheboundaries</strong>, <strong>@worldyouthfestival</strong> on your posted twibbon on Instagram or any other social media platform.</li><li>Share the program information for the World Youth Festival using this poster: <a href="https://bit.ly/WYF25poster" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">World Youth Fest Poster</a> with 3 WhatsApp groups or any other social media groups.</li></ul><p>Take a screenshot of each action mentioned above and upload them to your storage drive. Then, copy the link and paste it into the input forms provided above. Ensure that the folder is <strong>accessible to the public</strong> and not set to private.</p>";s:17:"confirmation_desc";s:1714:"<h1>World Youth Festival 2025</h1><p>The World Youth Festival provides both <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">Fully Funded</strong> and <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">Self-Funded</strong> Opportunities. To qualify for <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">Full Funding</strong>, delegates must complete all registration steps and fulfill payment by the specified deadline. If not selected for Full Funding, delegates can still participate through a self-funded scheme.</p><p>The comprehensive expenses outlined in the World Youth Festival payment cover accommodation throughout the program (<strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">October 6 - 9, 2025</strong>), including airport transfers on the first day (<strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">October 6, 2025</strong>, for transfer from the airport to the hotel) and the last day of the program (<strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">October 9, 2025</strong>, for transfer from the hotel to the airport). It's crucial to note that all fully funded or self-funded payments do not cover flight tickets and visa expenses. The fully-funded spots will be allocated based on the registrants' quality.</p><p>With a delegate quota limited to only <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">200 youth</strong>, let's join hands and collaborate at the World Youth Festival 2025. Your contribution is <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">essential</strong> for a shared and <strong style="color: rgb(19, 137, 253);">impactful</strong> experience.</p><p class="ql-align-center"><em>I am </em><strong><em>ready</em></strong><em> to join the World Youth Festival 2025 in </em><strong><em>Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia</em></strong><em>.</em></p>";s:9:"is_active";s:1:"1";s:20:"is_registration_open";s:1:"1";s:10:"is_deleted";s:1:"0";s:10:"created_at";s:19:"2024-02-12 20:29:22";s:10:"updated_at";s:19:"2025-07-03 15:33:24";s:7:"web_url";s:18:"worldyouthfest.com";s:8:"logo_url";s:46:"https://storage.ybbfoundation.com/logo/WYF.png";s:21:"registration_payments";a:2:{s:11:"self_funded";a:8:{s:2:"id";s:2:"26";s:4:"name";s:30:"Registration Fee (Self-Funded)";s:11:"description";s:30:"Registration Fee (Self-Funded)";s:10:"usd_amount";s:5:"13.00";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2025-07-18 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2025-10-01 00:00:00";s:12:"is_available";b:1;s:9:"is_active";b:1;}s:12:"fully_funded";a:8:{s:2:"id";s:2:"20";s:4:"name";s:31:"Registration Fee (Fully Funded)";s:11:"description";s:31:"Registration Fee (Fully Funded)";s:10:"usd_amount";s:5:"10.00";s:10:"start_date";s:19:"2025-04-15 00:00:00";s:8:"end_date";s:19:"2025-07-18 00:00:00";s:12:"is_available";b:0;s:9:"is_active";b:1;}}}}}}